<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX100 index in past month.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX100 index in past month.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the month to July 25.</p>
<p>    Top 10 largest gains in month		  Percent</p>
<p>Rank Name				    Price     change</p>
<p> 1   Macquarie Bank	   13.30	16.97</p>
<p> 2   Fletcher-Energy div   4.43	13.59</p>
<p> 3   Santos			6.19	12.34</p>
<p> 4   Village Road-Pr	 3.64	10.30</p>
<p> 5   FH Faulding		 8.20	10.07</p>
<p> 6   Howard Smith	     13.62	 9.75</p>
<p> 7   Brambles Inds	    27.80	 9.41</p>
<p> 8   Oil Search		  3.87	 9.01</p>
<p> 9   Rural Press		 4.36	 9.00</p>
<p>10   Aust Foundation	   2.62	 8.71</p>
<p>    Top 10 largest falls in month		  Percent</p>
<p>Rank Name				    Price     change</p>
<p> 1   Newcrest Mining	   2.61     -29.05</p>
<p> 2   Goldfields		  1.40     -27.08</p>
<p> 3   Acacia Resources	  1.40     -21.35</p>
<p> 4   Lihir Gold		  1.83     -17.94</p>
<p> 5   RGC			   3.97     -17.46</p>
<p> 6   Plutonic Rsc		3.59     -14.11</p>
<p> 7   Sthn Pac Pete	     3.80     -10.59</p>
<p> 8   PMP Comms		   3.22	-9.30</p>
<p> 9   M.I.M. Hlds		 1.79	-8.67</p>
<p>10   WMC			   7.74	-7.86</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
